Third-party notices for src/refill.c / src/refill.h (niimath `-refill-*`)
=========================================================================

src/refill.c is a C port of the MATLAB sources listed below.  The original copyright
and permission notices are reproduced as their licences require.

Algorithm citation (please cite when using the `-refill-*` operations):
  Robinson, S.D., Bollmann, S., Hodono, S., et al., 2023. "Improved dynamic distortion
  correction for fMRI using single-echo EPI and a readout-reversed first image (REFILL)."
  Human Brain Mapping 44(15):5095-5112.  https://doi.org/10.1002/hbm.26440

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. REFILL-Dynamic-Distortion-Correction
   (https://github.com/simon-mri/REFILL-Dynamic-Distortion-Correction)
   Ported: rescale.m, refill_calc_readout_gradient.m, refill_calc_fms.m,
           refill_do_dc.m, aspire_unwarp.m
